        "label": "Base Image 4K",
        "model": "gemini-2.5-flash-image",
        "style": "",
        "prompt": "A strikingly beautiful young woman standing in a bright empty artist's loft,\nmedium three-quarter shot from the chest up, body angled slightly left, calm\nconfident expression, looking just off-camera. Symmetrical features, high\ncheekbones, clear natural skin with visible texture, expressive eyes, soft\nfull lips, chestnut hair loosely pulled up with a few strands falling free.\nEditorial beauty, natural and believable, minimal makeup.\nShe wears a plain mustard-yellow linen jacket over a white cotton t-shirt, a\nthin silver chain necklace, and small round glasses. One hand rests at her\nside holding a closed hardback book.\nBehind her, a large multi-pane window on the left, a bare white brick wall, a\nsingle wooden stool, and an empty wooden easel. Overcast midday daylight, soft\nand even, no harsh shadows. Neutral color grade, natural skin tones. 50mm lens,\nf/4, sharp focus front to back. Generous headroom and open space to her right.\nClean, uncluttered composition. Photorealistic, fine detail in the fabric weave\nand individual hair strands.",
        "provider": "gpt-image-2",
        "resolution": "4K",
        "aspectRatio": "16:9",
        "fieldMappings": {},
        "negativePrompt": "text, watermark, logo, signature, extreme close-up, dramatic lighting, harsh\nshadows, heavy color grade, motion blur, bokeh, cluttered background, multiple\npeople, cropped head, distorted hands, airbrushed plastic skin, over-smoothed\nface, heavy makeup, duplicate limbs",
