        "approved": true,
        "feedback": "Reduce the slight AI smoothness on the skin — pores and micro-texture are underdeveloped compared to a real photograph. Sharpen the lens distortion on the glasses frames to match the optical refraction a real lens would produce. Add subtle corneal reflections and more iris detail to avoid the faintly frozen-eye quality.",
